url: "https://sparkainlpx.xyz"
abstract: >-
  SYNTHETIC unified verdict for the claims in Mun Seok Lee's preprint
  "Digital to Wave: LGD In Situ Wave Memory-Human Wave Integrated
  Interface-Metaverse Hologram- Wave Affective AI" (Part II). It
  applies Fourier duality to unify two falsifications: the Abbe
  diffraction limit on the THz readout (best case 301 MB readable
  vs 79.6 ZB claimed, short by 2.65 x 10^14) and the relativistic de
  Broglie wavelength on the matter-wave hologram (70 kg at 370 km/s:
  lambda = 2.56 x 10^-41 m, 1.17 x 10^37 times shorter than the 1 THz
  wavelength; most generous case short by 1.68 x 10^19). The joint
  bound counts the lattice sites satisfying both at once: zero, for
  every macroscopic mass and THz frequency. The FAIL is shown robust
  to bounded analog calibration (0.0223 orders) and to input noise
  (Omega-Genesis spooky correlation 0.99999995, verdict stable 5/5).
  A benefits manifest and a reusable template (claim, Abbe, de
  Broglie, joint, bounded calibration, noisy-copy spooky, verdict)
  are included for testing other wave-memory claims. No physical,
  biological or safety claim is made. The preprint's author has not
  reviewed or endorsed this software. DOI pending (no Zenodo record
  yet).
keywords:
